## Standalone Link

```jsx
<div className="flex flex-col gap-5">
  <Link href="#" iconBefore={PdfFileIcon}>
    Look I'm a standalone link
  </Link>
  <Link href="#" iconBefore={ArrowRightIcon}>
    I'm also a standalone link
  </Link>
  <Link href="#" iconAfter={NewWindowIcon} size="xsmall">
    I'm a standalone link too
  </Link>
</div>
```

## Inline Link

```tsx
<div className="flex flex-col gap-5">
  <div>
    <Heading size="9" className="font-bold">
      Inline link - no icon
    </Heading>
    <p className="typography-body-9">
      Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur,{' '}
      <Link href="#" type="inline">
        look, I'm an inline link
      </Link>{' '}
      adipisicing elit. Libero facilis odit voluptate reprehenderit laborum numquam ex optio doloribus magni repudiandae
      vero fugiat iusto tempora debitis sunt laboriosam nobis, ut voluptatum?
    </p>
  </div>
  <div>
    <Heading size="9" className="font-bold">
      Inline link - icon before
    </Heading>
    <p className="typography-body-9">
      Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur,{' '}
      <Link href="#" type="inline" iconBefore={PdfFileIcon}>
        look, I'm an inline link
      </Link>{' '}
      adipisicing elit. Libero facilis odit voluptate reprehenderit laborum numquam ex optio doloribus magni repudiandae
      vero fugiat iusto tempora debitis sunt laboriosam nobis, ut voluptatum?
    </p>
  </div>
  <div>
    <Heading size="9" className="font-bold">
      Inline link - icon after
    </Heading>
    <p className="typography-body-9">
      Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur,{' '}
      <Link href="#" iconSize="xsmall" type="inline" iconAfter={NewWindowIcon} size="small">
        look, I'm an inline link
      </Link>{' '}
      adipisicing elit. Libero facilis odit voluptate reprehenderit laborum numquam ex optio doloribus magni repudiandae
      vero fugiat iusto tempora debitis sunt laboriosam nobis, ut voluptatum?
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
```

## Icon sizes

```jsx
<div className="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
  <Link href="#" iconBefore={PdfFileIcon} iconSize="xlarge">
    Extra large
  </Link>
  <Link href="#" iconBefore={PdfFileIcon} iconSize="large">
    Large
  </Link>
  <Link href="#" iconBefore={PdfFileIcon} iconSize="medium">
    Medium
  </Link>
  <Link href="#" iconBefore={PdfFileIcon} iconSize="small">
    Small (default)
  </Link>
  <Link href="#" iconBefore={PdfFileIcon} iconSize="xsmall">
    Extra small
  </Link>
</div>
```

## Using Next Link

```jsx
<Link tag={NextLink} href="#">
  I'm using the Next Link
</Link>
```
